{"id":"91619cb364dc95c9","group":"72","path":"72/72-df-infinite-sequent.md","title":"Infinite Sequent","display":"df-infinite-sequent — Infinite Sequent","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-df-infinite-sequent","aliases":["72-df-infinite-sequent"],"display":"df-infinite-sequent — Infinite Sequent","depends_on":["[[72-df-sequent-calculus]]","[[72-df-calculus-syntax]]","[[72-df-propositional-evaluation]]"],"source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.I §1.2.14 print17/PDF29; local arbitrary-set context extension","verification_status":"source-statement-checked; explicit local encoding checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-df-infinite-sequent"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-df-infinite-sequent</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-infinite-sequent — Infinite Sequent"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f9452e4a7788a117\" href=\"?note=f9452e4a7788a117\" title=\"72-df-sequent-calculus\">72-df-sequent-calculus</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"3c073b947b255638\" href=\"?note=3c073b947b255638\" title=\"72-df-calculus-syntax\">72-df-calculus-syntax</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5c014dab66d624c8\" href=\"?note=5c014dab66d624c8\" title=\"72-df-propositional-evaluation\">72-df-propositional-evaluation</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.I §1.2.14 print17/PDF29; local arbitrary-set context extension"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked; explicit local encoding checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X_\\Sigma=\\mathrm{Fml}_{72}(\\Sigma)\">\\(X_\\Sigma=\\mathrm{Fml}_{72}(\\Sigma)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma,\\Delta\\subseteq X_\\Sigma\">\\(\\Gamma,\\Delta\\subseteq X_\\Sigma\\)</span> 是任意集合上下文。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak M\">\\(\\mathfrak M\\)</span> 为五分量签名的非空结构，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s:V\\to|\\mathfrak M|\">\\(s:V\\to|\\mathfrak M|\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak M,s\\models A\">\\(\\mathfrak M,s\\models A\\)</span> 是按有限语法树、标准经典真值及量词语义递归的满足关系，等号在结构中解释为相等。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Structure}_\\Sigma\">\\(\\operatorname{Structure}_\\Sigma\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|\\mathfrak M|\">\\(|\\mathfrak M|\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak M,s\\models A\">\\(\\mathfrak M,s\\models A\\)</span> 直接取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5c014dab66d624c8\" href=\"?note=5c014dab66d624c8\" title=\"72-df-propositional-evaluation\">72-df-propositional-evaluation</a> 的递归定义。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SetImage}_\\Sigma\">\\(\\operatorname{SetImage}_\\Sigma\\)</span> 的输入另用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma_0,\\Delta_0\\in\\operatorname{CtxSeq}_\\Sigma\">\\(\\Gamma_0,\\Delta_0\\in\\operatorname{CtxSeq}_\\Sigma\\)</span>；它们是有限序列，不是上文的集合上下文。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Seq}^{\\infty}_\\Sigma:=\\mathcal P(X_\\Sigma)^2,\\qquad\\Gamma\\Rightarrow^\\infty_\\Sigma\\Delta:=\\langle\\Gamma,\\Delta\\rangle.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Seq}^{\\infty}_\\Sigma:=\\mathcal P(X_\\Sigma)^2,\\qquad\\Gamma\\Rightarrow^\\infty_\\Sigma\\Delta:=\\langle\\Gamma,\\Delta\\rangle.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak M,s\\models\\Gamma\\Rightarrow^\\infty_\\Sigma\\Delta:\\Longleftrightarrow(\\forall A\\in\\Gamma\\ (\\mathfrak M,s\\models A))\\to\\exists B\\in\\Delta\\ (\\mathfrak M,s\\models B).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathfrak M,s\\models\\Gamma\\Rightarrow^\\infty_\\Sigma\\Delta:\\Longleftrightarrow(\\forall A\\in\\Gamma\\ (\\mathfrak M,s\\models A))\\to\\exists B\\in\\Delta\\ (\\mathfrak M,s\\models B).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SetImage}_\\Sigma(\\Gamma_0\\Rightarrow_\\Sigma\\Delta_0):=\\operatorname{ran}(\\Gamma_0)\\Rightarrow^\\infty_\\Sigma\\operatorname{ran}(\\Delta_0).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{SetImage}_\\Sigma(\\Gamma_0\\Rightarrow_\\Sigma\\Delta_0):=\\operatorname{ran}(\\Gamma_0)\\Rightarrow^\\infty_\\Sigma\\operatorname{ran}(\\Delta_0).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>无限上下文相继式另用∞箭头及独立载体，不与有限序列的Seq混同。SetImage明确丢失次序和重复次数；无穷分支规则不要求其结论本身有无穷上下文。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-sequent-calculus","status":"resolved","id":"f9452e4a7788a117","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-sequent-calculus]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-calculus-syntax","status":"resolved","id":"3c073b947b255638","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-calculus-syntax]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-propositional-evaluation","status":"resolved","id":"5c014dab66d624c8","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-propositional-evaluation]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-propositional-evaluation","status":"resolved","id":"5c014dab66d624c8","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Structure}_\\Sigma$、$|\\mathfrak M|$、$\\mathfrak M,s\\models A$ 直接取 [[72-df-propositional-evaluation]] 的递归定义。$\\operatorname{SetImage}_\\Sigma$ 的输入另用 $\\Gamma_0,\\Delta_0\\in\\operatorname{CtxSeq}_\\Sigma$；它们是有限序列，不是上文的集合上下文。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X_\\Sigma=\\mathrm{Fml}_{72}(\\Sigma)","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma,\\Delta\\subseteq X_\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathfrak M","display":false},{"tex":"s:V\\to|\\mathfrak M|","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathfrak M,s\\models A","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Structure}_\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"|\\mathfrak M|","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathfrak M,s\\models A","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{SetImage}_\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma_0,\\Delta_0\\in\\operatorname{CtxSeq}_\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Seq}^{\\infty}_\\Sigma:=\\mathcal P(X_\\Sigma)^2,\\qquad\\Gamma\\Rightarrow^\\infty_\\Sigma\\Delta:=\\langle\\Gamma,\\Delta\\rangle.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathfrak M,s\\models\\Gamma\\Rightarrow^\\infty_\\Sigma\\Delta:\\Longleftrightarrow(\\forall A\\in\\Gamma\\ (\\mathfrak M,s\\models A))\\to\\exists B\\in\\Delta\\ (\\mathfrak M,s\\models B).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{SetImage}_\\Sigma(\\Gamma_0\\Rightarrow_\\Sigma\\Delta_0):=\\operatorname{ran}(\\Gamma_0)\\Rightarrow^\\infty_\\Sigma\\operatorname{ran}(\\Delta_0).","display":true}],"bytes":1969,"backlinks":[{"id":"00439897fba390aa","anchor":"ref-29","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[72-df-infinite-sequent|df-infinite-sequent — Infinite Sequent]]"},{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-29","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[./72-df-infinite-sequent|df-infinite-sequent — Infinite Sequent]]"}],"outgoing":["f9452e4a7788a117","3c073b947b255638","5c014dab66d624c8"]}